{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c737","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06fb9-e0fc-7072-adfc-69f8598926a4"},"sequence":502,"recorded_at":1780531400000999,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"694249df-ed90-4909-b924-7901358b9328","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"694249df-ed90-4909-b924-7901358b9328","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"694249df-ed90-4909-b924-7901358b9328"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"bdd1a84a-96bc-43ed-9600-bee6ed0431ef"},"task_id":"bdd1a84a-96bc-43ed-9600-bee6ed0431ef","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"bdd1a84a-96bc-43ed-9600-bee6ed0431ef","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-18-1\",\n  \"command\": \"sed -n '2840,2930p' internal/specdoc/SPEC.md; echo \\\"=====2900-2915\\\"; sed -n '2900,2915p' internal/specdoc/SPEC.md; echo \\\"=====7.3/7.4/7.5 tables\\\"; grep -n \\\"capability_status\\\\|CapabilityStatus\\\\|capability_evidence\\\\|architecture\\\\|platform.*amd64\\\\|amd64.*arm64\\\" internal/specdoc/SPEC.md | head -n 30\",\n  \"description\": \"Inspect probe/quiesce spec sections\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"no reliable primary adapter is accepted\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"prompt_spawn\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"unknown\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"not claimed for v0.3.0\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"native_goal_binding\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"unsupported\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"provider_contract\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"no native task-board goal binding\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"warnings\\\": []\\n}\\n~~~\\n\\nThe probe object is closed and every displayed member is required.\\n<code>provider_version</code> is a 1–128 character exact version string,\\narchitecture is <code>amd64</code> or <code>arm64</code>, and\\n<code>capabilities</code> contains exactly the seven requested registry keys.\\nEach capability value contains exactly <code>status</code>,\\n<code>enabled</code>, <code>evidence</code>, and a 0–2,048 character\\n<code>detail</code>. <code>warnings</code> is a sorted, unique array of at most\\n1,024 strings of at most 2,048 characters each.\\n\\nStatus is one of <code>available</code>, <code>conditional</code>,\\n<code>unsupported</code>, or <code>unknown</code>. Only\\n<code>available</code> MAY set <code>enabled</code> true. Evidence is one of\\n<code>documented</code>, <code>probed</code>, <code>accepted_test</code>,\\n<code>provider_contract</code>, <code>inferred</code>,\\n<code>acceptance_required</code>, or <code>none</code>.\\n\\n### 7.5 Required operations\\n\\nAll plugins MUST implement every operation and return\\n<code>capability_unavailable</code> when the provider lacks the surface.\\n\\nEvery request and success <code>body</code> is a closed object. The following\\nembedded types are part of provider protocol 2.0.0:\\n\\n| Type | Exact members and constraints |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| <code>LeaseToken</code> | <code>session_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>lease_epoch:uint53 &gt; 0</code>, <code>lease_id:UUIDv4</code> |\\n| <code>WorkspacePaths</code> | <code>map(UUIDv7,absolute-path)[1..256]</code>; paths are destination-native, canonical, and contain no NUL |\\n| <code>TerminalDescriptor</code> | <code>backend:tmux&#124;conpty</code>, <code>terminal_id:string[1..512]</code>, <code>interactive:boolean</code>, <code>columns:uint16[1..1000]</code>, <code>rows:uint16[1..1000]</code> |\\n| <code>ProcessObservation</code> | <code>terminal_id:string[1..512]</code>, <code>executable_path:absolute-path</code>, <code>started_at:timestamp</code>, <code>candidate_store_paths:sorted unique absolute-path[0..256]</code>, <code>candidate_native_ids:sorted unique string[0..256]</code>; no PID is carried |\\n| <code>SpawnPlan</code> | <code>argv:array&lt;string&gt;[1..128]</code>, <code>cwd:absolute-path</code>, <code>env_names:sorted unique environment-name[0..64]</code>, <code>env_literals:map(environment-name,string)[0..64]</code>, <code>native_session_id:string[1..512]&#124;null</code>, <code>profile_mapping:string[1..512]</code>, <code>extensions:object</code>; argv/literal limits and secret rules equal Section 5.1 |\\n| <code>SafeBoundaryProof</code> | <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>provider_version:string[1..128]</code>, <code>input_blocked:boolean</code>, <code>boundary_ref:string[1..1024]&#124;null</code>, <code>foreground_idle:boolean</code>, <code>background_idle:boolean&#124;null</code>, <code>open_child_count:uint53</code>, <code>open_database_handle_count:uint53</code>, <code>store_generation:string[1..512]&#124;null</code>, <code>safe:boolean</code>, <code>blockers:sorted unique enum[0..5]</code> |\\n| <code>ValidationEvidence</code> | <code>code:string[1..128]</code>, <code>status:passed&#124;skipped</code>, <code>detail:string[0..2048]</code> |\\n| <code>NativeDiscoveryProof</code> | <code>native_session_id:string[1..512]</code>, <code>discovered:boolean</code>, <code>discovery_root:absolute-path&#124;null</code>, <code>backend_resolved:boolean</code> |\\n| <code>ProcessClosure</code> | <code>process_closed:boolean</code>, <code>store_closed:boolean</code>, <code>exit_code:int32&#124;null</code>, <code>remaining_process_handles:sorted unique string[0..256]</code>, <code>final_store_generation:string[1..512]&#124;null</code> |\\n| <code>DoctorFinding</code> | <code>severity:info&#124;warning&#124;error</code>, <code>code:string[1..128]</code>, <code>message:string[1..4096]</code>, <code>remediation:string[1..4096]&#124;null</code>, <code>evidence:documented&#124;probed&#124;accepted_test&#124;provider_contract&#124;inferred&#124;acceptance_required&#124;none</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderStoreAuthority</code> | <code>authority_id:root-id</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows</code>, <code>root_path:absolute-path</code>, <code>root_role:durable_store&#124;durable_index&#124;derived_cache</code>, <code>access:capture_source&#124;materialize_destination</code> |\\n| <code>AuthorityTarget</code> | <code>authority_id:root-id</code>, <code>relative_path:.&#124;path</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderCaptureItem</code> | <code>source_authority_id:root-id</code>, <code>source_relative_path:path</code>, <code>manifest_path:path</code>, <code>kind:file&#124;directory</code>, <code>state_class:durable_payload&#124;durable_index&#124;derived_cache</code>, <code>required:boolean</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderCapturePlan</code> | <code>capture_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>source_authorities:ProviderStoreAuthority[1..32]</code>, <code>items:ProviderCaptureItem[1..32768]</code>, <code>excluded_targets:AuthorityTarget[0..4096]</code>, <code>store_generation:string[1..512]</code>, <code>snapshot_requires_closed_store:boolean</code> |\\n| <code>ObjectSink</code> | <code>root:absolute-path</code>, <code>layout:sha256_loose_v1</code>, <code>create_mode:exclusive</code>, <code>max_bytes:uint53</code>, <code>max_blobs:uint53</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderObjectSourceAuthority</code> | <code>authority_id:provider_objects</code>, <code>kind:provider_object_source</code>, <code>root_path:absolute-path</code>, <code>layout:sha256_loose_v1</code>, <code>access:read_only</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>manifest_ids:sorted unique digest[1..1024]</code>, <code>max_bytes:uint53</code>, <code>max_blobs:uint53</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionAuthority</code> | <code>authority_id:provider_transaction</code>, <code>kind:provider_transaction</code>, <code>root_path:absolute-path</code>, <code>layout:provider_transaction_v1</code>, <code>access:read_write</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>transaction_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>plan_id:digest</code>, <code>same_filesystem_provider_authority_ids:sorted unique root-id[1..32]</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionEntry</code> | <code>sequence:uint53&gt;0</code>, <code>provider_authority_id:root-id</code>, <code>target_relative_path:path</code>, <code>expected_prior_digest:digest&#124;null</code>, <code>prior_kind:absent&#124;file&#124;directory&#124;symlink&#124;hardlink</code>, <code>backup_relative_path:path&#124;null</code>, <code>applied:boolean</code>, <code>restored:boolean</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionDocument</code> | <code>protocol:urn:ax:protocol:provider</code>, <code>protocol_version:2.0.0</code>, <code>document_kind:materialization_transaction</code>, <code>operation_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>transaction_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>plan_id:digest</code>, <code>state:preparing&#124;prepared&#124;committing&#124;committed&#124;rolling_back&#124;rolled_back</code>, <code>rollback_token:base64url-256+&#124;null</code>, <code>entries:ProviderTransactionEntry[1..65536]</code>, <code>native_discovery:NativeDiscoveryProof&#124;null</code>, <code>created_at:timestamp</code>, <code>updated_at:timestamp</code>, <code>terminal_at:timestamp&#124;null</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionStatus</code> | <code>operation_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>transaction_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>transaction_authority_id:provider_transaction</code>, <code>plan_id:digest&#124;null</code>, <code>state:unknown&#124;prepared&#124;committed&#124;rolled_back</code>, <code>rollback_token:base64url-256+&#124;null</code>, <code>native_discovery:NativeDiscoveryProof&#124;null</code> |\\n\\nThe <code>SafeBoundaryProof.blockers</code> enum is\\n<code>background_unproven</code>, <code>child_process_open</code>,\\n<code>database_handle_open</code>, <code>provider_busy</code>, or\\n<code>store_unstable</code>. A safe proof requires empty blockers,\\n<code>input_blocked</code>, <code>foreground_idle</code>,\\n<code>background_idle = true</code>, both counts zero, and non-null boundary and\\nstore generation. <code>ValidationEvidence</code> arrays MUST be sorted by\\n<code>code</code> with no duplicate code. Opaque process handles are valid only\\nfor the operation lifetime and MUST NOT be persisted or replicated.\\n\\nThe <code>root-id</code> grammar is\\n<code>[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}</code>. Capture authorities are sorted by\\n<code>authority_id</code>, have <code>access = capture_source</code>, and are\\nunique. Capture items are sorted by <code>manifest_path</code>; each authority\\nreference MUST resolve, and\\n<code>root_path/source_relative_path</code> MUST remain under that exact root\\nafter symlink/reparse-point resolution. Items MUST neither overlap nor traverse\\nthrough a symlink. Excluded targets are sorted by authority ID then relative\\npath and MUST reference the same authority set. <code>derived_cache</code> is\\nincluded only when Section 8 identifies it as required discovery metadata;\\notherwise it must be excluded. Provider roots that contain credentials,\\nmachine authentication, runtime sockets, locks, or live ax state MUST be\\nrejected even when a plugin names them. <code>ObjectSink.root</code> is a fresh owner-only directory\\ncreated by <code>ax</code>. Under <code>sha256_loose_v1</code>, a plugin writes\\n=====2900-2915\\n| <code>ObjectSink</code> | <code>root:absolute-path</code>, <code>layout:sha256_loose_v1</code>, <code>create_mode:exclusive</code>, <code>max_bytes:uint53</code>, <code>max_blobs:uint53</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderObjectSourceAuthority</code> | <code>authority_id:provider_objects</code>, <code>kind:provider_object_source</code>, <code>root_path:absolute-path</code>, <code>layout:sha256_loose_v1</code>, <code>access:read_only</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>manifest_ids:sorted unique digest[1..1024]</code>, <code>max_bytes:uint53</code>, <code>max_blobs:uint53</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionAuthority</code> | <code>authority_id:provider_transaction</code>, <code>kind:provider_transaction</code>, <code>root_path:absolute-path</code>, <code>layout:provider_transaction_v1</code>, <code>access:read_write</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>transaction_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>plan_id:digest</code>, <code>same_filesystem_provider_authority_ids:sorted unique root-id[1..32]</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionEntry</code> | <code>sequence:uint53&gt;0</code>, <code>provider_authority_id:root-id</code>, <code>target_relative_path:path</code>, <code>expected_prior_digest:digest&#124;null</code>, <code>prior_kind:absent&#124;file&#124;directory&#124;symlink&#124;hardlink</code>, <code>backup_relative_path:path&#124;null</code>, <code>applied:boolean</code>, <code>restored:boolean</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionDocument</code> | <code>protocol:urn:ax:protocol:provider</code>, <code>protocol_version:2.0.0</code>, <code>document_kind:materialization_transaction</code>, <code>operation_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>transaction_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>plan_id:digest</code>, <code>state:preparing&#124;prepared&#124;committing&#124;committed&#124;rolling_back&#124;rolled_back</code>, <code>rollback_token:base64url-256+&#124;null</code>, <code>entries:ProviderTransactionEntry[1..65536]</code>, <code>native_discovery:NativeDiscoveryProof&#124;null</code>, <code>created_at:timestamp</code>, <code>updated_at:timestamp</code>, <code>terminal_at:timestamp&#124;null</code> |\\n| <code>ProviderTransactionStatus</code> | <code>operation_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>materialization_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>transaction_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>transaction_authority_id:provider_transaction</code>, <code>plan_id:digest&#124;null</code>, <code>state:unknown&#124;prepared&#124;committed&#124;rolled_back</code>, <code>rollback_token:base64url-256+&#124;null</code>, <code>native_discovery:NativeDiscoveryProof&#124;null</code> |\\n\\nThe <code>SafeBoundaryProof.blockers</code> enum is\\n<code>background_unproven</code>, <code>child_process_open</code>,\\n<code>database_handle_open</code>, <code>provider_busy</code>, or\\n<code>store_unstable</code>. A safe proof requires empty blockers,\\n<code>input_blocked</code>, <code>foreground_idle</code>,\\n<code>background_idle = true</code>, both counts zero, and non-null boundary and\\nstore generation. <code>ValidationEvidence</code> arrays MUST be sorted by\\n<code>code</code> with no duplicate code. Opaque process handles are valid only\\nfor the operation lifetime and MUST NOT be persisted or replicated.\\n=====7.3/7.4/7.5 tables\\n99:The settled product and architecture decisions attached to\\n2679:    \\\"architecture\\\": \\\"arm64\\\",\\n2799:The <code>probe</code> operation body contains platform, architecture,\\n2811:  \\\"architecture\\\": \\\"arm64\\\",\\n2862:architecture is <code>amd64</code> or <code>arm64</code>, and\\n3073:| <code>probe</code> | <code>{platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows, architecture:amd64&#124;arm64, provider_executable:absolute-path&#124;null, requested_capabilities:sorted unique capability-name[0..7]}</code> | Provider Probe object (Section 7.4) |\\n3086:| <code>doctor</code> | <code>{platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows, architecture:amd64&#124;arm64, provider_executable:absolute-path&#124;null, identity:Provider Identity Record&#124;null}</code> | <code>{provider_id:provider-id, provider_version:string[1..128]&#124;null, findings:DoctorFinding[0..1024]}</code> |\\n3629:<code>architecture=amd64|arm64</code>,\\n3789:| <code>probe</code> | <code>{platform:macos\\\\|linux\\\\|wsl2\\\\|windows,architecture:amd64\\\\|arm64,requested_environment_ids:sorted unique environment-id[0..64],requested_capabilities:sorted unique directory-capability[0..8],extensions}</code> | <code>{host_id:UUIDv7,node_build:DirectoryNodeBuild,policy_digest:digest,environments:EnvironmentObservation[0..256],findings:AdapterFinding[0..4096],extensions}</code> | none |\\n3918:| Muse / Linux amd64 or arm64 | C / U / C | Official launcher artifacts; not executed. |\\n3921:| Antigravity / macOS amd64 or arm64 | C / U / C | Resume works only when the authenticated backend realm resolves the UUID; <code>Stop.fullyIdle</code> is documented. |\\n3922:| Antigravity / Linux amd64 or arm64 | C / U / C | Native family documented; keyring/DBus and PTY tests required. |\\n3924:| Antigravity / native Windows amd64 or arm64 | C / U / C | Native family documented; ConPTY, data-root expansion, and file-lock tests required. |\\n6265:| <code>platform</code>, <code>architecture</code> | AX platform and <code>amd64|arm64</code> |\\n6715:<code>capability_evidence_ids:sorted unique digest[1..256]</code>,\\n12324:behavior, not architecture choices:\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 15370,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 3843,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
