{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c75b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06fb9-e0fc-7072-adfc-69f8598926a4"},"sequence":520,"recorded_at":1780531400001035,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"694249df-ed90-4909-b924-7901358b9328","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"694249df-ed90-4909-b924-7901358b9328","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"694249df-ed90-4909-b924-7901358b9328"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"551f1c1d-1499-434f-a881-63c7c078c59c"},"task_id":"551f1c1d-1499-434f-a881-63c7c078c59c","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"551f1c1d-1499-434f-a881-63c7c078c59c","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-19-1\",\n  \"command\": \"sed -n '2795,2870p' internal/specdoc/SPEC.md; echo \\\"=====2080-2090\\\"; sed -n '2080,2090p' internal/specdoc/SPEC.md; echo \\\"=====3070-3080\\\"; sed -n '3070,3080p' internal/specdoc/SPEC.md; echo \\\"=====platform probe request line\\\"; grep -n \\\"platform:macos\\\" internal/specdoc/SPEC.md | head\",\n  \"description\": \"Read spec probe and identity vocabularies\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"The manifest declares possible surfaces, not runtime availability.\\n\\n### 7.4 Capability result\\n\\nThe <code>probe</code> operation body contains platform, architecture,\\nprovider executable path, and requested capability names. Its response MUST\\nidentify the exact provider version and emit every known capability using\\n<code>urn:ax:schema:provider-probe</code> version <code>1.0.0</code>:\\n\\n~~~json\\n{\\n  \\\"schema\\\": \\\"urn:ax:schema:provider-probe\\\",\\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"1.0.0\\\",\\n  \\\"provider_id\\\": \\\"pi\\\",\\n  \\\"provider_version\\\": \\\"0.73.1\\\",\\n  \\\"platform\\\": \\\"macos\\\",\\n  \\\"architecture\\\": \\\"arm64\\\",\\n  \\\"capabilities\\\": {\\n    \\\"native_resume\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"available\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": true,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"probed\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"--session, --continue, and --resume are present\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"portable_store\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"conditional\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"acceptance_required\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"closed-store cross-host fixture has not passed\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"managed_pty\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"conditional\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"acceptance_required\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"platform PTY interruption and flush gate has not passed\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"appserver\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"unsupported\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"provider_contract\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Pi RPC is not claimed as the ax appserver capability\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"task_board_primary\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"unknown\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"no reliable primary adapter is accepted\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"prompt_spawn\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"unknown\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"not claimed for v0.3.0\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"native_goal_binding\\\": {\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"unsupported\\\",\\n      \\\"enabled\\\": false,\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"provider_contract\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"no native task-board goal binding\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"warnings\\\": []\\n}\\n~~~\\n\\nThe probe object is closed and every displayed member is required.\\n<code>provider_version</code> is a 1–128 character exact version string,\\narchitecture is <code>amd64</code> or <code>arm64</code>, and\\n<code>capabilities</code> contains exactly the seven requested registry keys.\\nEach capability value contains exactly <code>status</code>,\\n<code>enabled</code>, <code>evidence</code>, and a 0–2,048 character\\n<code>detail</code>. <code>warnings</code> is a sorted, unique array of at most\\n1,024 strings of at most 2,048 characters each.\\n\\nStatus is one of <code>available</code>, <code>conditional</code>,\\n<code>unsupported</code>, or <code>unknown</code>. Only\\n=====2080-2090\\n| <code>subject_id</code> | UUIDv7 | Equal to <code>session_id</code> |\\n| <code>session_id</code> | UUIDv7 | Existing logical session |\\n| <code>provider_id</code> | provider-id | Must equal the Session Record provider |\\n| <code>provider_version</code> | string[1..128] | Exact probed version |\\n| <code>provider_version_range</code> | string[1..256] | Adapter compatibility range used for this identity |\\n| <code>native_session_id</code> | string[1..512] | Opaque provider handle; never interpreted by core |\\n| <code>identity_kind</code> | enum | <code>session_uuid</code>, <code>session_path_or_id</code>, <code>backend_conversation_uuid</code>, <code>task_board_managed</code>, or <code>provider_defined</code> |\\n| <code>logical_workspace_id</code> | UUIDv7 | Member of the Session Record workspace group |\\n| <code>backend_realm_fingerprint</code> | digest or null | Non-secret fingerprint; non-null when backend/account realm is a resume precondition |\\n| <code>opaque_identity</code> | map(provider-identity-key,string[1..1024])[0..32] | Explicit adapter data map defined below |\\n| <code>created_by_host_id</code> | UUIDv7 | Identifying owner host |\\n=====3070-3080\\n| Operation | Exact request body | Exact success body |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| <code>manifest</code> | <code>{}</code> | Provider Manifest object (Section 7.3) |\\n| <code>probe</code> | <code>{platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows, architecture:amd64&#124;arm64, provider_executable:absolute-path&#124;null, requested_capabilities:sorted unique capability-name[0..7]}</code> | Provider Probe object (Section 7.4) |\\n| <code>launch</code> | <code>{session_record:Session Record, workspace_paths:WorkspacePaths, execution_profile:standard&#124;yolo, launch_plan:Launch Plan, terminal:TerminalDescriptor}</code> | <code>SpawnPlan</code> |\\n| <code>identify-session</code> | <code>{session_id:UUIDv7, provider_id:provider-id, observation:ProcessObservation}</code> | <code>{identity:Provider Identity Record, confidence:exact&#124;strong&#124;weak, matched_evidence:sorted unique native_id&#124;store_path&#124;provider_event&#124;backend_lookup[1..4]}</code> |\\n| <code>quiesce</code> | <code>{identity:Provider Identity Record, terminal:TerminalDescriptor, timeout_ms:uint53[1..3600000], lease:LeaseToken}</code> | <code>{proof:SafeBoundaryProof}</code> |\\n| <code>native-store-plan</code> | Tagged <code>NativeStorePlanRequest</code>: capture is <code>{phase:capture, identity:Provider Identity Record, source_platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows, mode:snapshot&#124;handoff&#124;fork, source_workspace_paths:WorkspacePaths, lease:LeaseToken}</code>; materialize is <code>{phase:materialize, identity:Provider Identity Record, source_platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows, destination_platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows, destination_host_id:UUIDv7, mode:snapshot&#124;handoff&#124;fork, source_manifest_id:digest, destination_workspace_paths:WorkspacePaths, lease:LeaseToken}</code> | Tagged <code>NativeStorePlanResult</code>: capture is <code>{phase:capture, capture_plan:ProviderCapturePlan, include_classes:sorted unique string[0..128], exclude_classes:sorted unique string[0..128]}</code>; materialize is <code>{phase:materialize, materialization_plan:Materialization Plan, include_classes:sorted unique string[0..128], exclude_classes:sorted unique string[0..128], path_key_rewrites:map(UUIDv7,string[1..1024])[0..256]}</code> |\\n| <code>capture</code> | <code>{operation_id:UUIDv7, capture_plan:ProviderCapturePlan, proof:SafeBoundaryProof, object_sink:ObjectSink, lease:LeaseToken}</code> | <code>{operation_id:UUIDv7, capture_id:UUIDv7, manifest:Transfer Manifest, blob_descriptors:sorted unique Blob Descriptor[0..32768], written_blob_ids:sorted unique digest[0..32768], captured_store_generation:string[1..512], exclusions_applied:sorted unique string[0..128]}</code> |\\n| <code>materialize</code> | <code>{operation_id:UUIDv7, materialization_id:UUIDv7, transaction_id:UUIDv7, plan:Materialization Plan, object_source:ProviderObjectSourceAuthority, transaction:ProviderTransactionAuthority, destination_workspace_paths:WorkspacePaths, lease:LeaseToken}</code> | <code>{operation_id:UUIDv7, materialization_id:UUIDv7, transaction_id:UUIDv7, plan_id:digest, state:prepared, created_paths:sorted unique absolute-path[0..65536], merged_paths:sorted unique absolute-path[0..65536], validations:ValidationEvidence[1..256], rollback_token:base64url-256+, native_discovery:NativeDiscoveryProof}</code> |\\n| <code>materialize-status</code> | <code>{materialization_id:UUIDv7, transaction_id:UUIDv7, transaction:ProviderTransactionAuthority}</code> | <code>ProviderTransactionStatus</code> |\\n=====platform probe request line\\n1132:| <code>probe</code> | <code>{platform:macos\\\\|linux\\\\|wsl2\\\\|windows,os_version:string[1..256],requested_capabilities:sorted-unique TerminalBackendCapability[0..16],deadline_at:timestamp}</code> | <code>{probe:TerminalBackendProbe,evidence:sorted-by-evidence_id unique CapabilityEvidence[0..256]}</code> |\\n2489:<code>platform:macos|linux|wsl2|windows</code>,\\n2896:| <code>ProviderStoreAuthority</code> | <code>authority_id:root-id</code>, <code>provider_id:provider-id</code>, <code>platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows</code>, <code>root_path:absolute-path</code>, <code>root_role:durable_store&#124;durable_index&#124;derived_cache</code>, <code>access:capture_source&#124;materialize_destination</code> |\\n3073:| <code>probe</code> | <code>{platform:macos&#124;linux&#124;wsl2&#124;windows, architecture:amd64&#124;arm64, provider_executable: